The program of omp-target-term-messages.m, compiled by the driver for the
machine's GPU and run there: the host copies each message for the region into
host memory, which the GPU copies into its arena, and the GPU copies each one
it sends into host memory, from which the host queues it.
REQUIRES: amdgpu-gpu

RUN: merkc -fopenmp --offload-arch=%offload-arch %libomp-flags %S/omp-target-term-messages.m -o %t
RUN: %libomp-env OMP_TARGET_OFFLOAD=MANDATORY timeout -k 1 60 %t \
RUN:   | FileCheck %S/omp-target-term-messages.m --check-prefix=OUTPUT --match-full-lines --strict-whitespace
RUN: merkc -O2 -fopenmp --offload-arch=%offload-arch %libomp-flags %S/omp-target-term-messages.m -o %t.O2
RUN: %libomp-env OMP_TARGET_OFFLOAD=MANDATORY timeout -k 1 60 %t.O2 \
RUN:   | FileCheck %S/omp-target-term-messages.m --check-prefix=OUTPUT --match-full-lines --strict-whitespace
